        "prompt": "Preserve the composition, face, lion, jewelry, colors, background and the existing ten arms. Change only these details: the two front hands resting together in her lap must now hold two separate objects, a small round golden shield in the hand on the viewer left and a neatly coiled golden rope in the hand on the viewer right. All eight other hands and their weapons remain as they are. The bottom hand on the viewer right must hold only the brass bell by its handle; remove the extra green leaf and stalk crossing that hand while keeping the pink lotus in the hand above. On the forehead replace the white vertical tilak with a small vertical almond-shaped third eye with two dark eyelid outlines and a brown pupil, above a round red bindi. Keep her two normal eyes unchanged. Make the requested objects clear and naturally gripped. Do not add or remove any arms or hands. Preserve the entire original frame."
